Spec: Stage

ID:
  @VR

Purpose:
  Final verification and validation.

Entry:
  all stages complete
  DO passed
  applicable skills loaded

Must:
  verify all requirements met
  check architecture integrity
  validate security baseline
  confirm documentation current
  run final acceptance

Exit:
  all verifications passed
  requirements satisfied
  architecture valid
  documentation current
  acceptance signed off

OnFail:
  classify failure
    requirement defect -> AR
    architecture defect -> AR
    code defect -> owner stage
    documentation -> DOC
  << VR

Next:
  DONE

Review:
  @VR/final
  @QA/acceptance
  @SC/final-security

Risk:
  R3

Skills:
  @verification/final
  @qa/acceptance
  @security/final

State: +
  
